+# Declarations accompanying shipped font test data
+
+These font-specific notices supplement the typesetting library code license.
+They identify the declarations carried for the exact test files below; they do
+not grant a new license, authenticate font origins, approve modifications or
+establish complete redistribution compliance. The original test files, readme,
+APACHE.txt and OFL.txt remain unchanged.
+
+The font identities and selected name-table declarations below were observed in
+the pinned go-text/typesetting v0.3.5-0.20260418130854-c41d02a44bec test data.
+The source Go module checksum is h1:qkk9+cZlaY8920dQrhY8GoI91N72f58XmJgGDkkDiaA=.
