+The test readme and the shipped Roboto name table both declare Apache-2.0.
+`OFL_AMIRI.txt` exactly copies the existing Amiri-specific `testdata/OFL.txt`,
+whose project copyright matches the font name table. Neither fixture declaration
+is replaced or removed.
