+`OFL_SELAWIK.txt` copies Microsoft's original family notice, including the
+Reserved Font Name Selawik and trademark statement: https://github.com/microsoft/Selawik/blob/89362e84731d1f5777fa078fd4d5ebbd339e4378/LICENSE.txt
+Git blob: `ac8fdb956049621af2aecd3a8253c38789748c4a`.
